        {
          "text": "Lino Josefa wakatolwa ku-Egepita, nkabela Potifara, umwi wabasilutwe ba-Farao, sikulanga wabasikutabilila, muntu mu-Egepita, wakamuula kuzwa kumaanza aaba-Ismayeli ibakamuletede nkuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.1",
